	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "DEUTSCH DTM series 8-way right-angle PCB receptacle with vertical 4-slot panel flange, -R004 flange mod (DTM13-08PA-R004, key A). Derived by hand from TE customer drawing DTM13-08PA-R004 rev D. Pin grid .165 [4.191] across x .250+/-.010 [6.35+/-.25] along the mating axis; pin dia .041+/-.002 [1.04+/-.05]; nearer row (pins 1-4) .170+/-.015 [4.32+/-.38] behind the flange rear face. The flange is VERTICAL (perpendicular to the board), 2.700 x 1.300 [68.58 x 33.02] plus four R.250 ears carrying 8.89 x 2.54 mm slots at +/-12.07 mm (x) and +/-15.37 mm (z) about the flange centre, which sits 16.61 mm from the pin-field centre toward +x; flange and housing hang BEYOND the board edge and extend ~4.4 mm below the board top surface, so the board edge MUST lie between the rear pad row and the flange rear face (Dwgs.User line at y=+6.35 is the recommended edge). Base block on the board .953 [24.21] wide x ~12.7 deep x .204 [5.18] high; pin tails .137+/-.015 [3.47+/-.38] below the base. Nothing retains the connector on the board except its 8 pins: S9 must provide a bracket/panel for the flange slots. Mates DTM06-08SA. Contact rating 7.5 A.")
	(tags "connector deutsch dtm dtm13 8way horizontal right-angle flange automotive sealed")
